# Field of Ruin: "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Destroy target nonbasic land an opponent controls." Bot2's basic Island and
# Bot1's own nonbasic Tundra are refused, Bot2's Bazaar of Baghdad is destroyed. Then each player searches (no "may": no
# question to accept) for a basic land card: Bot2 gets Forest, Bot1 gets Plains (the Tundra in its library is not basic,
# CR 205.4a). Both enter untapped. The {2} is paid exactly: after the activation Bot1's lands are all tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Island
Field of Ruin
Island x14
Tundra
Island
Plains

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Bazaar of Baghdad
Island x16
Island
Island
Forest

